# Hand-written -- the downloaded LightTube_LP.obj had no .mtl of its own.
# map_Kd is the tube's normal color texture; _ARM.png/_Normal.png from the
# same download aren't usable without shader changes (unlit + single-texture
# shader: shader\unlitTexturePS.cso).
#
# STEP11: this shader is NOT actually unlit -- it multiplies the sampled
# texture by the scene's (very dim) ambient/diffuse light, so the earlier
# trick of pointing map_Kd at the _Em glow map just made a dim, flat image
# instead of an actual glow. Real fix: the loader now parses Ke (emissive)
# below and the shader adds Material.Emission on top of the lit color, so
# the tube glows regardless of scene lighting. map_Kd is back to the normal
# color texture.
newmtl Tube
Ns 250.000000
Ka 1.000000 1.000000 1.000000
Kd 1.000000 1.000000 1.000000
Ks 0.000000 0.000000 0.000000
Ke 3.000000 3.000000 2.600000
Ni 1.450000
d 1.000000
illum 1
map_Kd LightTube_LP_Color.png
